26
00:46:51,002 --> 00:46:53,202
Minus Kiara! Haha!

27
00:46:54,302 --> 00:46:58,702
If you start feeling unwell at any point,

28
00:46:58,702 --> 00:47:03,202
please don't push yourself, just reach out for help and hydrate.

29
00:47:03,702 --> 00:47:08,202
For everyone's safety, please avoid any dangerous or disruptive behavior.

30
00:47:09,002 --> 00:47:12,702
