01:09:27,717 --> 01:09:29,717
I can hear you guys so clearly and I can see you guys so clearly!

215
01:09:35,417 --> 01:09:39,417
Oh my god! We're in Los Angeles!

216
01:09:40,717 --> 01:09:42,217
Yay!

217
01:09:43,217 --> 01:09:52,717
So we started off with the iconic and classic songs of mine, Hinotori and Sparks.

218
01:09:50,217 --> 01:09:53,717
Don't we love those songs? Wasn't it hype?

219
01:09:54,717 --> 01:10:02,217
Yeah, you guys know like Hinotori was my first ever original song to put out...

220
01:10:04,079 --> 01:10:09,039
history, my musical journey, and it's a song that means a lot to me,

221
01:10:09,039 --> 01:10:13,599
and it's just so hype. It was also the first ever time that I appeared in 3D, I think,

222
01:10:13,599 --> 01:10:17,519
long time ago at fest in Japan, right, remember?

223
01:10:17,599 --> 01:10:19,579
Good times. Yeah!

224
01:10:21,193 --> 01:10:24,033
Thank you so much for cheering so loudly, you did so well!

225
01:10:24,193 --> 01:10:26,433
Yeah!

226
01:10:27,273 --> 01:10:33,873
I have been training so hard the past months in the gym, trying to get stamina for this day,

227
01:10:34,053 --> 01:10:42,873
because I think I learned about, learned and relearned about 20 choreographies.

228
01:10:43,993 --> 01:10:44,513
Yeah!

229
01:10:48,293 --> 01:10:53,893
Damn, that was a lot of work. But finally the day has come to show it to all of you.

230
01:10:54,193 --> 01:11:00,853
I want to say hi, by the way, to all the live viewers worldwide!

231
01:11:01,233 --> 01:11:04,713
There's so many cinemas showing this concert right now!

232
01:11:04,853 --> 01:11:07,593
Hello world!

233
01:11:08,333 --> 01:11:10,953
Can you hear me? I wonder if I can hear them.

234
01:11:11,453 --> 01:11:12,593
Can I hear them over the continents?

235
01:11:15,033 --> 01:11:16,393
Well, that's you guys!

236
01:11:17,553 --> 01:11:19,053
Well, I think I can hear them. Yeah!

237
01:11:19,973 --> 01:11:26,853
Also, there is Senchou Marine's watching on YouTube right now, like Ollie and all the EN members.

238
01:11:29,333 --> 01:11:30,613
Hi, thank you!

239
01:11:31,313 --> 01:11:32,533
So excited!

240
01:11:35,093 --> 01:11:40,613
I have to give a little bit of an announcement from my side, actually,

241
01:11:41,373 --> 01:11:46,633
because it's very important. This has to be in the free part, because everybody needs to hear this.

242
01:11:47,193 --> 01:11:49,373
My new album, Hoshigirai,

243
01:11:49,793 --> 01:11:50,893
you got it, right?

244
01:11:52,853 --> 01:11:54,033
Thank you!

245
01:11:54,453 --> 01:11:59,813
But in case you didn't, a second round of album sales has begun!

246
01:12:03,893 --> 01:12:12,913
So if you missed it previously or you want a new copy, starting from Saturday, March 28th at 11:00 PM,

247
01:12:15,273 --> 01:12:20,933
we'll find out, probably tasty, you will be able to order Hoshigirai again.

248
01:12:20,933 --> 01:12:22,953
So please everybody, order Hoshigirai!

249
01:12:23,533 --> 01:12:28,753
So far the songs that I performed up until now were not even from Hoshigirai,

250
01:12:28,753 --> 01:12:31,813
but don't worry, I'm squeezing everything in that I can.

251
01:12:34,053 --> 01:12:48,293
Okay guys, you probably aware of this, but the free part usually ends after an MC.

252
01:12:48,293 --> 01:12:50,913
But free part, you only had two songs?

253
01:12:51,373 --> 01:12:53,893
Nah, nah, nah, nah. Don't worry, I told staff,

254
01:12:54,253 --> 01:12:58,713
we can't be having that. I want the free part to have a little bit more, yeah.

255
01:12:59,553 --> 01:13:05,853
So it will continue a little bit more and then it will cut before our MC. So just so you know.

256
01:13:05,853 --> 01:13:13,353
And then once it cuts, please streaming tickets are available still in the description and in the pinned comments.

257
01:13:15,493 --> 01:13:21,013
Yes, so make sure to get your ticket because what you haven't even seen yet is my colleague,

258
01:13:21,433 --> 01:13:23,533
Ninomae Ina'nis, right?

259
01:13:26,493 --> 01:13:36,453
The concert is split in half, so today you only have me in the free part, but later if you want to see more of Walla and Ina, go get streaming tickets!

